#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:5 041c43b318ed45209cb8f5d1b1412e78
msgid "Mission Planner Advanced Tools"
msgstr "Mission Planner 高级工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:7 60f8dd4ba1cb470ba27cb267822d6c2f
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has many advanced tools which are normally hidden from the "
"user. These can be accessed via pressing CTRL-F. Many have use only to "
"developers or advanced users, but a few can be useful to regular users."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 内置了许多通常对用户隐藏的高级工具，可通过按 CTRL-F "
"访问。其中许多工具仅供开发人员或高级用户使用，但也有一些对普通用户很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:12 5c30a6db08c9492b828733a4cd983a4d
msgid ""
"Some useful utilities are: MAVLink Inspector, BootLoader Upgrade, MAVLink "
"(Forwarding), and Warning Manager."
msgstr "一些常用工具包括：MAVLink 检查器、引导程序升级、MAVLink（转发）和警告管理器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:15 74377d0dfeaa4c0b9528022c333f68e0
msgid "MAVLink Inspector"
msgstr "MAVLink 检查器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:17 297c85f9b6df46338e00a6cdcffb2889
msgid ""
"This allows a real time inspection of the MAVLink values being sent. A user "
"can see any measurement/reading being sent and normally stored in a TLOG, in"
" real time. A user selected number of historical points of a data value can "
"be graphed real-time also."
msgstr ""
"该工具允许实时查看正在发送的 MAVLink 数值。用户可以实时查看任何通常存储在 TLOG "
"中的测量值/读数。还可以对选定数量的历史数据点进行实时图形化显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:23 34d7937ae4b34751a62e3f3d4d7336a3
msgid "BootLoader Upgrade"
msgstr "引导程序升级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:25 e956f450ca8a40a6ab1b4145b9e95a22
msgid ""
"Often the boot loader supplied by an autopilot vendor may be out of date. "
"Using this button will automatically update the autopilots bootloader. If it"
" is already current, then no update will occur."
msgstr "飞控厂商提供的引导程序可能已过时。使用此按钮将自动更新飞控的引导程序。若已是最新版本，则不会执行更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:28 04a0334d8eeb43819783d6d9e963b982
msgid "Mavlink"
msgstr "Mavlink"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:30 ab21fcb9933e48249b8a8a57d5ee3383
msgid ""
"This allows forwarding of your connected autopilots MAVLink stream via the "
"internet to another user with a public IP address. This is often used by "
"users to help another user debug issues."
msgstr "该功能允许通过互联网将已连接飞控的 MAVLink 数据流转发给拥有公网 IP 地址的其他用户，常用于帮助他人排查问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:35 d2fd945bbc544418be302f0a2a9cf9d7
msgid "Select this tool"
msgstr "选择此工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:36 d37c7d0f4f664bc7a436ccae176c1685
msgid ""
"Next a dialog will open with drop-downs to allow selection of communication "
"port. For remote connections usually UDP will be chosen. For TCP or UDP, the"
" baud rate selection box is unimportant."
msgstr "接下来将弹出一个对话框，提供下拉菜单供选择通信端口。远程连接通常选择 UDP。对于 TCP 或 UDP，波特率选择框不重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:37 8e8da589ee81497dadd2f26b25ebca54
msgid ""
"Click this box if you want the remote party to be able to change parameters "
"on you autopilot or control it remotely."
msgstr "如果希望远程用户能够修改飞控参数或对其进行远程控制，请勾选此框。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:38 005d5c13ad884660a37fcef5df942a0a
msgid ""
"When \"Connect\" is selected, depending on communications port, the public "
"IP address of the recipient and port dialogs will open for input."
msgstr "选择「Connect」后，根据通信端口的不同，将弹出对话框要求输入接收方的公网 IP 地址和端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:40 7c3cbb82d6234de5869654f652de4d6e
msgid ""
"After this, the remote site should start getting MAVLink packets from your "
"autopilot. They can use whatever ground station they chose to receive them."
msgstr "完成后，远程端应开始接收来自您飞控的 MAVLink 数据包，他们可使用任意地面站软件接收。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:42 39d08da11f4c4d47a8bef5b9400d81d6
msgid "You can forward MAVLink packets to only one location."
msgstr "MAVLink 数据包只能转发至一个目标地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:44 06f1cd09bf7b41a997aaac3344793f68
msgid ""
"UDP is usually recommended instead of TCP since TCP requires acknowledgment "
"of packets and network delays can slow down Joystick response to the point "
"of causing crashes. UDP will continue to send control commands without "
"waiting for acknowledgment of previous data reception."
msgstr ""
"通常建议使用 UDP 而非 TCP，因为 TCP 需要对数据包进行确认，网络延迟可能导致摇杆响应迟滞，进而引发事故。UDP "
"无需等待前一数据被确认即可继续发送控制指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:47 efeed01516094f618e89ca7fbc616197
msgid "Forwarding Locally"
msgstr "本地转发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:49 6d7a941e0980433b861beee4de67dd71
msgid ""
"You can also forward locally so that multiple ground control stations can "
"connect to the locally attached autopilot on the same PC. In this case just "
"use the local PC's localhost ip address of 127.0.0.1. You then can connect "
"another GCS like MAVProxy or QGC on the same PC."
msgstr ""
"也可以进行本地转发，使同一台 PC 上的多个地面站软件都能连接到本地飞控。此时只需使用本机的 localhost 地址 127.0.0.1，即可在同一台"
" PC 上连接 MAVProxy 或 QGC 等其他 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:52 1dd8e7d439dd46cf88e191b4836d6371
msgid "Warning Manager"
msgstr "警告管理器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:54 8e1b6293564d4a58acd05cf0a55b1ba8
msgid ""
"This allows the creation of custom audio warnings based on virtually any "
"measurement/status reading being received over the MAVLink connection to the"
" vehicle."
msgstr "该功能允许根据通过 MAVLink 连接接收到的任何测量值/状态读数，创建自定义语音警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mp-tools.rst:59 3c677977878d40638651040f3aa2737b
msgid ""
"You can select an incoming data item from the drop-down list, and compare it"
" against a limit and then have a phrase saved and spoken by Mission Planner."
msgstr "您可以从下拉列表中选择一个传入数据项，与限定值进行比较，然后由 Mission Planner 保存并朗读相应短语。"
